  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the full-scale Russian invasion of Ukraine in February 2022, HALO delivered a 15-month immediate response mine action programme. HALO delivered land release of contaminated areas, risk education, and built the capacity of national actors such as the State Emergency Services.</narrative>
